                    <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Eutrophication effects on CH<sub>4</sub> and CO<sub>2</sub> fluxes in a highly urbanized tropical reservoir (Southeast, Brazil)</h1>

                    <ul class="c-article-identifiers">
                        
        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item" data-test="article-category">Research Article</li>
    
    

                        <li class="c-article-identifiers__item">
                            Published: <time datetime="2021-04-02">02 April 2021</time>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
